WEBVTT

00:05:59.236 --> 00:06:00.516
at bottom,

00:06:00.556 --> 00:06:02.876
is that state of longing,

00:06:02.916 --> 00:06:05.516
that joy that's laced with sorrow.

00:06:05.556 --> 00:06:06.796
Which is often triggered

00:06:06.836 --> 00:06:09.396
when we experience something so exquisite

00:06:09.396 --> 00:06:12.516
that it seems to come to us
from some other world.

00:06:12.556 --> 00:06:15.156
And this is why we give
painters and rock stars

00:06:15.156 --> 00:06:16.836
such exalted status.

00:06:16.876 --> 00:06:19.636
Because they're the ones
who bring us the breath of magic

00:06:19.676 --> 00:06:21.276
from that other place.

00:06:22.356 --> 00:06:24.196
Except it only lasts a moment,

00:06:24.196 --> 00:06:27.756
and we really want to live there for good.

00:06:27.796 --> 00:06:30.556
Because we know that we live
in a deeply flawed world.